Package: speakersafetyd-aurora-profiles
Architecture: all
Multi-Arch: foreign
Depends: speakersafetyd (>= 3.0.0-1+aurora1), ${misc:Depends}
Description: speakersafetyd profiles for Aurora-supported Macs
 speakersafetyd models for Macs that speakersafetyd does not list itself: the
 MacBook Pro 16-inch M4 Pro/Max (J616) and the Mac Studio M4 Max (J575c). Each
 uses speakersafetyd's own model values for its speakers with the machine's
 voltage and current sense layout.
 .
 A restart of speakersafetyd within the same boot starts from the worst-case
 speaker temperature. Without a running daemon the kernel keeps the speaker
 volumes locked.
 .
 This legacy protection is deprecated and will be removed:
 aurora-speaker-upgrade moves a Mac to speakerguardd v2, which takes its
 values from the Mac itself.
